### Créer une note de frais
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes-de-frais
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "collaborateurId": "22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222",
  "annee": 2026,
  "mois": 9
}

> {% client.global.set("noteId", response.body.id); %}

### Lire la note
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notes-de-frais/{{noteId}}

### Ajouter une ligne (péage, sans plafond)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes-de-frais/{{noteId}}/lignes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeCategorie": "PEAGE",
  "dateDepense": "2026-09-10",
  "montantTtc": 12.50,
  "tva": 0,
  "libelle": "Péage A42",
  "justificatifFourni": false
}

### Ajouter un repas valide (25 € de plafond, justificatif fourni)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes-de-frais/{{noteId}}/lignes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeCategorie": "REPAS",
  "dateDepense": "2026-09-12",
  "montantTtc": 22.00,
  "tva": 2.20,
  "libelle": "Déjeuner client",
  "justificatifFourni": true
}

### ❌ Plafond dépassé → 422
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes-de-frais/{{noteId}}/lignes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeCategorie": "REPAS",
  "dateDepense": "2026-09-13",
  "montantTtc": 42.00,
  "tva": 4.20,
  "libelle": "Restaurant",
  "justificatifFourni": true
}

### ❌ Justificatif manquant → 422
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes-de-frais/{{noteId}}/lignes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeCategorie": "REPAS",
  "dateDepense": "2026-09-14",
  "montantTtc": 18.00,
  "tva": 1.80,
  "libelle": "Déjeuner",
  "justificatifFourni": false
}

### ❌ Date hors période → 422
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes-de-frais/{{noteId}}/lignes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeCategorie": "PEAGE",
  "dateDepense": "2026-08-25",
  "montantTtc": 9.00,
  "tva": 0,
  "libelle": "Péage août",
  "justificatifFourni": false
}

### ❌ Validation invalide → 400
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes-de-frais/{{noteId}}/lignes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeCategorie": "",
  "dateDepense": "2027-01-01",
  "montantTtc": -5,
  "tva": 0,
  "libelle": "",
  "justificatifFourni": false
}

### Soumettre
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes-de-frais/{{noteId}}/soumission

### ❌ Note soumise, plus modifiable → 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes-de-frais/{{noteId}}/lignes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "codeCategorie": "PEAGE",
  "dateDepense": "2026-09-15",
  "montantTtc": 8.00,
  "tva": 0,
  "libelle": "Péage retour",
  "justificatifFourni": false
}

### Valider
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes-de-frais/{{noteId}}/validation
Content-Type: application/json

{ "decideurId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111" }

### ❌ Transition interdite → 409
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes-de-frais/{{noteId}}/validation
Content-Type: application/json

{ "decideurId": "11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111111" }

### Rembourser
POST http://localhost:8080/api/notes-de-frais/{{noteId}}/remboursement
Content-Type: application/json

{ "decideurId": "33333333-3333-3333-3333-333333333333" }

### Lister les notes du collaborateur
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notes-de-frais?collaborateurId=22222222-2222-2222-2222-222222222222

### ❌ Note inexistante → 404
GET http://localhost:8080/api/notes-de-frais/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000